      "paperId": "cet6:2022-06-03",
      "kind": "instruction",
      "sourceText": "Directions: For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write an essay that begins with the sentence “Nowadays more and more people take delight in offering help to the needy.w You can make comments, cite examples, or use your personal experiences to develop your essay. You should write at least 150 words but no more than 200 words.",
